{"id":"658409","name":"鸡蛋虾仁炒丝瓜","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658409/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾滑","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中搅拌均匀。","img":"images/658409/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鲜虾去壳去虾线后洗净开背。","img":"images/658409/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"丝瓜去皮洗净切滚刀块。","img":"images/658409/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油倒入蛋液，将鸡蛋炒散后盛出。","img":"images/658409/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入丝瓜翻炒均匀。","img":"images/658409/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入炒过的鸡蛋。","img":"images/658409/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入虾仁翻炒均匀。","img":"images/658409/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"适量盐调味。","img":"images/658409/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/658409/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火煮开炒至断生即可。","img":"images/658409/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658409/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658409/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658409/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}